    "answer": {
      "short": "Median $=13$; IQR $=12$. Correct answer: D.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Range}&=25-5=20\\\\2x-6&=20\\\\2x&=26\\\\x&=13\\end{align*}$$\nThe ordered data are $5,6,11,13,13,18,25$. Exclude the middle value when dividing the data into halves.\n$$\\begin{align*}Q_1&=6\\\\Q_2&=13\\\\Q_3&=18\\\\\\mathrm{IQR}&=18-6=12\\end{align*}$$\nThe median is 13 and the IQR is 12. Correct answer: D.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
